Step 2 — Add IAM permission to Lambda role:

Lambda → Configuration → Permissions
→ Click role name → IAM opens
→ Add inline policy → JSON:

{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "ec2:StartInstances",
        "ec2:StopInstances",
        "ec2:DescribeInstances"
      ],
      "Resource": "*"
    }
  ]
}

Policy name: ec2-start-stop-policy
→ Create ✅

