================================================
RULE 1 - START RULE
================================================

Step 1 - EventBridge Console
→ EventBridge → Scheduled rules → Create rule

Step 2 - Define Rule Detail
→ Name:        start-jenkins-ec2
→ Description: Starts EC2 at 1:30 PM IST
→ Rule type:   Schedule
→ Click Next

Step 3 - Define Schedule
→ Select: A fine-grained schedule
→ Cron expression:
   minutes  = 0
   hours    = 8
   day      = *
   month    = *
   weekday  = ?
   year     = *
→ Full cron: 0 8 * * ? *
→ Verify: Next trigger shows 08:00 UTC
→ Click Next

Step 4 - Select Target
→ Target type  = AWS service
→ Target       = Lambda function
→ Function     = ec2-start-stop
→ Exec role    = Create new role

Step 5 - Additional Settings
→ Configure target input = Constant (JSON text)
→ JSON box type ONLY:
   {"action": "start"}
→ Click Next

Step 6 - Tags
→ Skip
→ Click Next

Step 7 - Review and Create
→ Verify all settings
→ Click Create rule ✅

